OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Verdi
OL,6,     F3/5. Kate Molleson explores the
OL,7,     Fopera that rescued Verdi's career
OL,8,     Fand transformed Italian opera.
OL,9,G1700 In Tune
OL,10,     FLive music from kora player Sura
OL,11,     FSusso and guitarist Habib Koite.
OL,12,     FSoprano Adriana Gonzalez on
OL,13,     Fstarring in Carmen.
OL,14,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,15,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Fsoundscape of classical music
OL,17,     Fincluding relaxing works by
OL,18,     FMozart, Rachel Portman and Jules
OL,19,     FMassenet.
