OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe celebrated Argentine pianist
OL,7,     FNelson Goerner plays a programme
OL,8,     Fthat includes JS Bach's Toccata in
OL,9,     FC minor, Schumann's Fantasie in C,
OL,10,     Fand Schubert's Piano Sonata in C
OL,11,     Fminor.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: John Foxx - Key Moments
OL,13,     FJohn Foxx takes us through the
OL,14,     Fhistory of the five pianos which
OL,15,     Fhave shaped his music. As the lead
OL,16,     Fsinger of Ultravox and a solo
OL,17,     Fartist, pianos have been his
OL,18,     Flife-long obsession.
